WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:07.150
Pear sells its new home screen on privacy.
Privacy from whom?

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:13.579
Her brother can't read her texts. Only her
face unlocks them.

00:00:14.529 --> 00:00:20.007
Then, in Pear's own ad, the family watches
her date on its door camera.

00:00:20.857 --> 00:00:26.586
Her texts are private. Her date isn't.
